  end

  PNPM -.->|workspace scripts| Hardhat
  PNPM -.->|frontend dev and build| Vite
  PNPM -.->|frontend tests| Vitest
  PNPM -.->|proof build and calldata| Snarkjs
  Hardhat -.->|compile, test, deploy| Solidity
  Snarkjs -.->|generated verifier artifact| LtvGroth16Verifier
  Vite -.->|serves DApp bundle| BrowserWallet
  Vitest -.->|executes UI tests| BrowserWallet

  NodeRuntime --> ExpressAPI
  BrowserWallet -->|"HTTP: /verify; /compliance"| ExpressAPI
  BrowserWallet -->|wallet JSON-RPC| HardhatRPC
  BrowserWallet -->|wallet JSON-RPC| SepoliaRPC
  ExpressAPI -->|ethers JSON-RPC| HardhatRPC
  ExpressAPI -->|ethers JSON-RPC| SepoliaRPC
  HardhatRPC --> ContractAccess
  SepoliaRPC --> ContractAccess

  ContractAccess ==>|transactions and calls| RoleAdminManager
  ContractAccess ==>|transactions and calls| Lending
  ContractAccess ==>|transactions and calls| PropertyVerification
  ContractAccess ==>|transactions and calls| ComplianceVerifier

  ComplianceVerifier ==>|"verifyProof()"| LtvGroth16Verifier
  ComplianceVerifier ==>|"setCompliant(); read valuation"| PropertyVerification
  Lending ==>|"ownerOf(); isVerified(); isCompliantFor()"| PropertyVerification
  RoleAdminManager ==>|"grantRole(); revokeRole()"| PropertyVerification
  RoleAdminManager ==>|"grantRole(); revokeRole()"| Lending

  RoleAdminManager --o AccessControl
  Lending --o AccessControl
  PropertyVerification --o AccessControl

